              "en": "vertex (h, k)",
              "ar": "الرأس (h، k)"
            },
            "colorClass": "amber",
            "value": "—"
          }
        ],
        "note": {
          "en": "The faint grey graph is the parent \\( y=|x| \\); the indigo one is the shifted version.",
          "ar": "الرسم الرمادي الباهت هو الدالة الأصل \\( y=|x| \\)؛ والرسم النيلي هو النسخة المُزاحة."
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Transformation",
              "ar": "التحويل"
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( f(x-h)+k \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Logarithm",
              "ar": "اللوغاريتم"
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\log_b x=y\\iff b^{y}=x \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Exponent law",
              "ar": "قانون الأسس"
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( b^{m}b^{n}=b^{m+n} \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Inverse",
              "ar": "العكسية"
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "swap \\( x \\) and \\( y \\)",
              "ar": "بدّل بين x وy"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 2.A",
          "ar": "مثال محلول 2.أ"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Solve \\( 2^{x}=8 \\). \\[ 2^{3}=8\\Rightarrow x=3. \\]",
          "ar": "حُل \\( 2^{x}=8 \\). \\[ 2^{3}=8\\Rightarrow x=3. \\]"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 2.B",
          "ar": "مثال محلول 2.ب"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "State the domain of \\( \\sqrt{x-2} \\). \\[ x\\ge 2. \\]",
          "ar": "حدّد مجال \\( \\sqrt{x-2} \\). \\[ x\\ge 2. \\]"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "warn",
        "label": {
          "en": "Practice Problem",
          "ar": "سؤال تدريبي"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Let \\(f(x)=x^2-4\\) and \\(g(x)=\\sqrt{x+4}.\\) Find \\((g\\circ f)(x)\\) and its domain. <details><summary>Show solution</summary><div>\\((g\\circ f)(x)=g(f(x))=\\sqrt{(x^2-4)+4}=\\sqrt{x^2}=|x|.\\) Domain: all real \\(x\\) (since \\(x^2\\ge0\\) always). So domain \\(=\\mathbb{R}.\\)</div></details>",
          "ar": "ليكن \\(f(x)=x^2-4\\) و\\(g(x)=\\sqrt{x+4}.\\) أوجد \\((g\\circ f)(x)\\) ومجالها. <details><summary>عرض الحل</summary><div>\\((g\\circ f)(x)=g(f(x))=\\sqrt{(x^2-4)+4}=\\sqrt{x^2}=|x|.\\) المجال: جميع الأعداد الحقيقية \\(x\\) (لأن \\(x^2\\ge0\\) دائمًا). إذن المجال \\(=\\mathbb{R}.\\)</div></details>"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
